---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy policy — AVARA by BLUVA"
  description="Privacy policy and personal data processing information for AVARA by BLUVA."
>
  <header class="legal-header">
    <div class="legal-container legal-nav">
      <a href="/en/" class="legal-logo" aria-label="AVARA by BLUVA">
        <img src="/images/logo-avara.png" alt="AVARA by BLUVA" />
      </a>

      <a href="/en/" class="legal-back">
        ← Back to the website
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="legal-main">
    <div class="legal-container">
      <div class="legal-heading">
        <p class="legal-eyebrow">Data protection</p>
        <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-date">Last updated: 15 October 2026</p>

        <p class="legal-notice">
          This English version is provided for information purposes.
          In the event of a discrepancy, please refer to the French version.
        </p>
      </div>

      <article class="legal-content">
        <section>
          <h2>1. Data controller</h2>

          <p>
            The website <strong>avarastudio.be</strong> is operated as part of
            the <strong>AVARA by BLUVA</strong> project, currently being
            established in Belgium.
          </p>

          <div class="legal-details">
            <p>
              <strong>Project owner:</strong><br />
              Thomas Dijoux
            </p>

            <p>
              <strong>Trading name:</strong><br />
              AVARA by BLUVA
            </p>

            <p>
              <strong>Status:</strong><br />
              Self-employed activity in the process of being established
            </p>

            <p>
              <strong>Email:</strong><br />
              contact@avarastudio.be
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Data collected</h2>

          <p>
            When you use the contact form, we may collect:
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>your name;</li>
            <li>your company name, when provided;</li>
            <li>your email address;</li>
            <li>your phone number, when provided;</li>
            <li>the type of project you are interested in;</li>
            <li>the content of your message.</li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            Technical data required for the operation and security of the
            website may also be processed by the technical service providers
            used to host the website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Why we use this data</h2>

          <p>The information submitted through the form is used to:</p>

          <ul>
            <li>respond to your enquiry;</li>
            <li>understand your project and requirements;</li>
            <li>discuss your project with you;</li>
            <li>prepare a potential proposal;</li>
            <li>follow up on the conversation.</li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            Your information is not automatically used to subscribe you to a
            newsletter or send advertising without an appropriate legal basis.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Legal basis</h2>

          <p>
            When you contact AVARA by BLUVA on your own initiative, the data
            you provide is processed in order to respond to your request and,
            where appropriate, prepare a future professional relationship.
          </p>

          <p>
            Technical processing necessary for the operation, security and
            management of the website may also rely on the legitimate interest
            in maintaining a functional and secure service.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Data recipients</h2>

          <p>
            Data is accessible only to those who need it in order to respond to
            enquiries and manage the AVARA by BLUVA activity.
          </p>

          <p>
            Technical providers may process data as part of their services,
            including:
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Netlify, Inc.</strong>, for website hosting and technical
              handling of form submissions;
            </li>
            <li>
              the email service used to receive notifications and respond to
              enquiries.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <p>Personal data submitted through the website is not sold to third parties.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Hosting and international transfers</h2>

          <p>
            The website and contact form are hosted through Netlify.
            Netlify may process certain data outside the European Economic
            Area, including in the United States.
          </p>

          <p>
            Such transfers are governed by the legal mechanisms applicable
            to international transfers of personal data.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Retention period</h2>

          <p>
            If an enquiry does not lead to a professional relationship, the
            information is retained only for as long as necessary to process
            and follow up on the request and will generally be deleted no later
            than <strong>12 months after the last exchange</strong>.
          </p>

          <p>
            If a professional relationship is established, certain data may be
            retained for longer when necessary to perform the relationship or
            comply with legal obligations.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Your rights</h2>

          <p>
            Subject to the applicable data-protection rules, you may request:
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>access to your personal data;</li>
            <li>correction of your data;</li>
            <li>deletion of your data;</li>
            <li>restriction of processing;</li>
            <li>objection to certain processing;</li>
            <li>data portability where applicable.</li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            To exercise your rights, contact
            <strong>contact@avarastudio.be</strong>.
          </p>

          <p>
            You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Belgian Data
            Protection Authority.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>9. Required and optional information</h2>

          <p>
            Fields marked as required are necessary to understand and respond
            to your request. Other information is optional.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>10. Cookies and third-party services</h2>

          <p>
            The website does not currently use advertising or marketing
            tracking tools to build visitor profiles.
          </p>

          <p>
            Some technical resources may be loaded from third-party services
            required for the website to display or operate correctly.
          </p>

          <p>
            If analytics, advertising pixels or other services requiring
            consent are introduced later, this policy will be updated and a
            consent mechanism will be implemented where required.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>11. Security</h2>

          <p>
            Reasonable technical and organisational measures are used to reduce
            the risk of loss, unauthorised access or misuse of submitted data.
          </p>

          <p>
            Data that is no longer required is periodically removed from the
            tools used to manage enquiries.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>12. Changes to this policy</h2>

          <p>
            This policy may be updated to reflect changes to the website,
            services used, the formal establishment of the business or
            applicable legal requirements.
          </p>

          <p>
            The most recent update date appears at the top of this page.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="legal-footer">
    <div class="legal-container legal-footer-inner">
      <div>
        <strong>AVARA</strong>
        <span>by BLUVA</span>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-footer-links">
        <a href="/en/">Home</a>
        <a href="/en/legal-notice/">Legal notice</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-container {
    width: min(calc(100% - 40px), 920px);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .legal-header {
    padding: 22px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.08);
    background: #f7f7f4;
  }

  .legal-nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .legal-logo img {
    display: block;
    width: 145px;
    height: auto;
  }

  .legal-back {
    color: #686868;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-main {
    padding: 100px 0 120px;
    background: #f7f7f4;
  }

  .legal-heading {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin-bottom: 65px;
  }

  .legal-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #6d5dfc;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .legal-heading h1 {
    font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5.2rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .legal-date {
    margin-top: 22px;
    color: #686868;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .legal-notice {
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding: 15px 18px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #efefe9;
    color: #686868;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .legal-content {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.08);
    border-radius: 30px;
    background: white;
  }

  .legal-content section {
    padding: 40px 44px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.08);
  }

  .legal-content section:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: #686868;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 18px 0 20px 20px;
    color: #686868;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .legal-content strong {
    color: #171717;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: #6d5dfc;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .legal-details {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 12px 40px;
    margin-top: 25px;
  }

  .legal-details p {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(23, 23, 23, 0.07);
  }

  .legal-footer {
    padding: 32px 0;
    background: #171717;
    color: white;
  }

  .legal-footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .legal-footer-inner > div:first-child {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .legal-footer-inner strong {
    font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif;
  }

  .legal-footer-inner span {
    color: #aaa1ff;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .legal-footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 22px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .legal-main {
      padding: 70px 0 90px;
    }

    .legal-content section {
      padding: 30px 24px;
    }

    .legal-details {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .legal-footer-inner {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
